                                "sense_id": "9ede1e34-8b36-38f4-9ba9-03951f1b3076",
                                "text": "‘Private: for the hands of J. G. Utterson alone and in case of his predecease to be destroyed unread,’ so it was emphatically superscribed; and the lawyer to behold the contents."
                            }
                        ]
